Description: fast and secure DOS emulator
 dosemu2 is an emulator for running DOS programs under linux.
 It can also serve as a VM to boot various DOSes.

Package: dosemu2-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: dosemu2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: dosemu2 development libs and headers
 This package contains libs and headers for building programs
 that communicate with dosemu2.
